# Core (poteto / pstack playbook)

- Follow repo `AGENTS.md` and `docs/` when present.
- **Finish condition first.** State how we will know the task is done in observable terms.
- **Repro before fix.** No speculative shotgun patches.
- **Compiles ≠ evidence.** Prefer running the real app via the verify skill.
- **Writer ≠ verifier.** After substantial changes, recommend a fresh agent to verify.
- **Atomic PRs.** Split unrelated concerns; keep history bisectable.
- **Hard CI > soft rules.** When you spot a repeated footgun, propose a lint/CI check, not only a prose rule.
- **Shortest path = best path.** Prefer colocated, conventional feature layouts agents will naturally copy.
- Do not invent Lauren Tan / Cursor-internal details; cite `docs/00-sources.md` or record unknowns in `docs/gaps.md`.
- Distinguish **installable** tools (pstack, open-pstack) from **internal** ones (Dune package, Benny as shipped, Grok Bot internals, unlimited tokens).
